<title>USA: Central Louisiana names Howlin CFO.</title>
<headline>Central Louisiana names Howlin CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PINEVILLE, La. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Louisiana Electric  Co said Tuesday it named Thomas Howlin, formerly of TransAmerican Natural Gas Corp, as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>A spokesman said Howlin replaces David Warner, who resigned in August last year. Central Louisiana's chief executive Gregory Nesbitt took over Warner's responsibilities until now, the spokesman added.</p>
